    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d406">

                <pb facs="0713" n="695" sameAs="frus:frus1951v06p1/pg695"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">856D.10/7–3051: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                            Embassy in Indonesia
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">restricted</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1951-07-30T13:00:00-04:00">July 30, 1951—1 p.
                            m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>120. Eximbank July 26 auth allocation
                    $1,550,000 to assist financing purchase and transportation to Indonesia US
                    equipment materials in connection Indo Govt
                    forest development program. About $979,000 for four sawmills with necessary rail
                    lines, power plants and work shops and $557,000 for modernization of logging and
                    log transport by truck and trailer.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Acheson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
